  "description_short": "Charming Great Brak River eatery serving wood-fired dishes and homestyle comfort food with a warm welcome.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on Charles Street in Great Brak River, Charcoal and Charm lives up to its name with a welcoming atmosphere and honest, flavourful cooking. The wood-fired approach brings out the best in their dishes, from perfectly charred meats to rustic pizzas that keep locals coming back.\n\nThe menu balances hearty comfort food with lighter options, making it equally suited for a casual family meal or a relaxed evening out. Great Brak River's laid-back charm extends right into this spot, where the service is friendly and the portions generous. It's the kind of neighbourhood gem that feels like a find, even though word has clearly spread among those who know their way around the Garden Route dining scene.",
